13. The Hon'ble Supreme Court in Goutam Kundu Vs. State of West Bengal and Anr AIR 1993 SC 2295, summarised the law on the subject as under:-
CA No. 39/2020 Seema Vs. Om Prakash page 6 of 10 "(i) That courts in India cannot order blood test as a matter of course;
(ii) Wherever applications are made for such prayers in order to have robing enquiry, the prayer for blood test cannot be entertained.
